sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Coordinator Proxy
    participant S as Shadow Failover
    participant N as Pump & Field Nodes

    Note over P,S: Normal Operation
    loop Every 1000ms
        P->>S: ESP-NOW Heartbeat (System OK)
    end
    
    Note over P,S: Catastrophic Event (Server Crash / Power Loss)
    P--xS: (Silence)
    S->>S: 1000ms: Missed Heartbeat 1
    S->>S: 2000ms: Missed Heartbeat 2
    S->>S: 3000ms: Missed Heartbeat 3 (Critical Timeout!)
    
    Note over S,N: Independent Hardware Override Engaged
    S->>N: Broadcast (ESP-NOW): CLOSE ALL VALVES
    S->>N: Broadcast (ESP-NOW): KILL PUMP POWER
